            "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"
          },
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-77b182970420dff76e4cd9a1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "ner_pretraining_corpus",
        "text": "论文引入大规模百度百科语料用于实体识别预训练，并称其为弱监督学习，因为没有真实的命名实体标注。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "soft_label_embedding",
        "text": "论文提出软标签嵌入（soft label embedding），用于在实体识别与关系抽取之间有效传递信息。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "three_technologies",
        "text": "论文结论称增强的 BERT 预训练、软标签嵌入和 NER 预训练是其引入以进一步改进性能的三项主要技术。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-0f3bf35195202e464e2739cc"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "ablation_baseline",
        "text": "实验中的基线模型基于 Google BERT，使用硬标签嵌入，并且仅在 SKE 数据集上训练、不做 NER 预训练。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-81f156727678132b6842efe6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "ablation_f1",
        "text": "在 SKE 数据集上，结合论文增强 BERT 后 F1 从 0.864 升至 0.871；使用额外语料的 NER 预训练、软标签嵌入以及辅助的句子级关系分类预测也提升了 F1。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-81f156727678132b6842efe6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "single_model_score",
        "text": "结合上述各项贡献，单模型在 testset-1 上取得 F1 0.876。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"
          },
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-81f156727678132b6842efe6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "ensemble_score",
        "text": "集成四个模型变体后，论文在 testset-1 上取得 F1 0.892（第 1 名），在 testset-2 上取得 F1 0.8924（第 2 名）。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"
          },
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-0f3bf35195202e464e2739cc"
          }
        ]
      }
